# System Actors

## Primary Actors

### Student

- Browse activities
- Register for activities
- Cancel reservations
- Join waiting lists
- View activity history
- Download certificates
- View transcripts

### Activity Organizer

- Create activities
- Edit activities
- Publish activities
- Manage participants
- Record attendance
- Issue certificates
- Generate reports

### Student Affairs Officer

- Manage activity categories
- Approve activities
- Generate reports
- Verify activity transcripts

## Supporting Actors

- University Identity and Authentication System
- Notification Service
- Academic and Graduation System
